# Anthropic API Key — get from https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Your work email (pitches you want to meet on will be forwarded here)
MY_WORK_EMAIL=aditya@yourfirm.com

# Disha's work email (consumer pitches forwarded here)
DISHA_EMAIL=disha@yourfirm.com

# Rejection email template — customize this
REJECTION_TEMPLATE=Hi {founder_name},

Thank you for reaching out and sharing the pitch for {company_name}. We appreciate the time you took to present your vision.

After careful consideration, we have decided to pass on this opportunity at this stage. This decision does not reflect on the merit of your work — it simply isn't the right fit for our current thesis/portfolio.

We wish you the very best with your fundraise and look forward to seeing your progress.

Best,
Aditya
